# .netrc file for Git authentication with private repositories
# Copy this file to .netrc and update with your credentials
#
# Format:
# machine <hostname>
# login <username>
# password <token>

machine github.com
login your-github-username
password your-github-token

# For SpectroCloud private repositories, you might need:
# machine github.com
# login your-spectrocloud-username  
# password your-spectrocloud-token

